  <details id="privacy">
    <summary>Privacy</summary>
    <p><strong>No tracking, cookies, ads or accounts.</strong> We do not record or upload your casts. App settings and receiver identity stay on your device.</p>
    <p>Cloudflare delivers this website, downloads and the startup update check, processing IP addresses and connection data for delivery and security. The update check sends no device IDs, installed version or cast content. We keep no application request logs; <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noreferrer">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a> explains its retention and worldwide processing.</p>
    <p>ELIAS OSWALD Solutions (details below) relies on legitimate interests for delivery, security and support. Support emails are kept until resolved, or as legally required. Contact <a href="mailto:help@elias.dev">help@elias.dev</a> for access, correction, deletion, restriction or objection. You may complain to <a href="https://uodo.gov.pl/en" rel="noreferrer">UODO</a> or your local data protection authority.</p>
  </details>
  <details id="terms">
    <summary>Terms</summary>
    <p>22Cast provides free AirPlay receiver software, downloads and release information. Casting requires Android 7 or later, a compatible ARM device, an Apple sender and a shared local network. The website requires a current browser. Compatibility with every device or protected streaming service is not guaranteed.</p>
    <p>Website service starts with your request and ends when it completes or you leave. You can stop casting or uninstall the app at any time. Use the service lawfully and only share content you are entitled to share.</p>
    <p>The software and corresponding source are available under <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html" rel="noreferrer">GPL-3.0-or-later</a>; included components retain their licenses. It is supplied without warranty to the extent allowed by law. Your GPL permissions and mandatory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p>
    <p>Send complaints, with a description and reply address, to <a href="mailto:help@elias.dev">help@elias.dev</a>. We will reply within 14 days. 22Cast is independent and is not affiliated with Apple. AirPlay is an Apple trademark.</p>
  </details>
  <details id="fairplay-disclaimer">
    <summary>FairPlay disclaimer</summary>
    <p>22Cast uses the third-party PlayFair library to handle FairPlay transport encryption. The legal status of this library and its use is unclear and may vary by jurisdiction. You are responsible for complying with applicable local law when using 22Cast.</p>
    <p>If you represent Apple and have legal concerns, contact <a href="mailto:help@elias.dev">help@elias.dev</a>. We will act immediately to resolve the issue, including removing affected functionality or suspending its distribution as appropriate.</p>
